  "decision_conditions": [
    "1. Due to inconsistent plans a true assessment could not be made to determine whether the proposed works&nbsp;fall within the provisions of permitted development, in accordance with Class B of Part 1 Schedule 2 of the Town and Country (Planning General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) due to -&nbsp;the proposed north section plan being&nbsp;illustrated with the rear dormer at a height of 2.3m and 0.2m setback but the proposed rear elevation plan has the dormer illustrated with a 3.1m height and no 0.2m setback from the eaves.the width of the extension above the first floor rear projection measures 1.43m on the proposed rear elevation plan but 1.63m on the proposed floor plan. the section of the dormer that extends above the first floor rear projection and main area of the dormer are&nbsp;illustrated at differing heights on the proposed north elevation.&nbsp;"
